<html><head><title>What to Learn Base Camp</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body>


    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Comprehensive HTML Example</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #35424a;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background: #35424a;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            background-color: #e8491d;
        }
        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        aside {
            float: right;
            width: 30%;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #e8491d;
            color: white;
        }
        article {
            float: left;
            width: 65%;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #35424a;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            clear: both;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        table, th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
        }
    </style>



<header>
    <h1>My Comprehensive HTML Page</h1>
    <p>Combining various HTML features in one document</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="container">
    <article>
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>This is an example of a comprehensive HTML document. Below, you can see different HTML elements such as headings, paragraphs, images, lists, forms, tables, and more.</p>
        
        <h3>Text Formatting</h3>
        <p><strong>Bold Text</strong></p>
        <p><em>Italic Text</em></p>
        <p><u>Underlined Text</u></p>
        <p><mark>Highlighted Text</mark></p>
        <p><small>Small Text</small></p>
        <p>This is a <a href="#link">link</a> to nowhere.</p>

        <h3>Image Example</h3>
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x200" alt="Sample Image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;">

        <h3>List Examples</h3>
        <h4>Ordered List</h4>
        <ol>
            <li>First Item</li>
            <li>Second Item</li>
            <li>Third Item</li>
        </ol>
        <h4>Unordered List</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Item One</li>
            <li>Item Two</li>
            <li>Item Three</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Table Example</h3>
        <table>
            <tbody><tr>
                <th>Name</th>
                <th>Age</th>
                <th>City</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>John Doe</td>
                <td>25</td>
                <td>New York</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Jane Smith</td>
                <td>30</td>
                <td>Los Angeles</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody></table>

        <h3>Form Example</h3>
        <form action="#" method="post">
            <label for="name">Name:</label><br>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name"><br>
            <label for="email">Email:</label><br>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email"><br>
            <label for="message">Message:</label><br>
            <textarea id="message" name="message"></textarea><br>
            <input type="submit" value="Submit">
        </form>
    </article>

    <aside>
        <h2>Side Information</h2>
        <p>This is some additional information that is displayed in the sidebar. You can use this section to highlight important news, updates, or advertisements.</p>
    </aside>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>Footer Content © 2024</p>
</footer>



</body></html>